@page
@model iD_Develops.Pages.LanguageAndCommunication.EnglishModel
@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Language & Communication English";
}
<section class="public-page">
    <div class="public-container public-content-narrow">
        <p class="public-eyebrow public-eyebrow-left">Language &amp; Communication</p>
        <h1 class="public-page-title">English</h1>
        <p class="public-copy">
        Even though you understand the English language perfectly fine,
        communication can be difficult if it’s not your mother tongue. 
        How to strike the right tone of voice? How to tune into your communication partner? 
        Especially in phone calls or particular business situations this may result in unconvenient situations. 
        Paying attention to cultural differences and suited to your needs you can either improve, optimise or start developing your English language skills.
        </p>
        <p class="public-copy">
        Point out your specific language needs here and we’ll look at the options together!
        </p>
    </div>
</section>
